WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: The Fading Spark (1-07)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: Carnaby Street (1983)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.700
[Staccato Synth Pulse & Echoing Flute Intro]

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.200
The lights are dimming in the hall

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.800
The shadows climbing up the wall

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.500
We check the dials, turn the wheel

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.800
But there is nothing left to feel

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.400
The engine shudders, then it stops

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.000
The pressure in the chamber drops

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.500
It's just a fading spark!

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.200
A flicker in the growing dark!

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.600
We're running out of time and space!

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.200
Inside this hollow, empty place!

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.000
The fading spark...

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.000
You search the wiring for a sign

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.600
You trace the path of every line

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.200
The system crashes, one by one

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.800
Until the work is left undone

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.400
We built the fortress way too high

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.800
And watched the colours bleed and die

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.400
It's just a fading spark!

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:35.200
A flicker in the growing dark!

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.500
We're running out of time and space!

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.200
Inside this hollow, empty place!

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:49.000
The fading spark...

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.400
Is it over?

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.200
Is it done?

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.800
Waiting for the fading sun...

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.400
No one's left to play the part

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:14.000
Hide the secret in your heart!

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:46.000
[Frantic Staccato Flute & Synth Solo]

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.500
It's just a fading spark!

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:53.500
A flicker in the growing dark!

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:57.200
We're running out of time and space!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.200
Inside this hollow, empty place!

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:05.000
The fading spark!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.500
Fade to grey...

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:12.200
Fade to black...

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:16.500
Fade to grey...

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:27.000
[Slowing Synth Pulse & Final Flute Breath Outro]
